# Environment variable examples for `make up`.
# Export CMOA_CONFIG and CMOA_BIND before running the launcher; it checks
# them before Compose starts and does not read .env itself.
# Compose-only monitor options may also be placed in an ignored .env file.
#
# CMOA_CONFIG=/absolute/path/to/cmoa.json
# CMOA_BIND=/path/to/workspace
# CMOA_MONITOR_HOST=0.0.0.0
# CMOA_MONITOR_PORT=3999
# CMOA_MONITOR_ROOTS=
# CMOA_MONITOR_CALIBRATIONS=
